1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320
Reading Task

2
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:04,600
The Sporting Robot

3
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:10,200
My name is Hua Fei, and I am a sporting robot of the 23rd century.

4
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:13,600
I am an expert at high flying exercises.

5
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:17,580
I jump from spaceships and as I fall I turn,

6
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:24,040
dive, circle and dance until I softly land as close as I can to the finishing line.

7
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:46,180
I won the silver medal for my performance.

8
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:56,120
I wanted to meet robots from other countries and explore ideas about our sport.

9
00:00:57,060 --> 00:01:01,320
However, my programmer fell ill the week before we were going to leave.

10
00:01:01,820 --> 00:01:05,520
It was very painful for her and I felt very frightened.

11
00:01:06,460 --> 00:01:09,440
I no longer felt so confident that I would win.

12
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:16,060
The day of the competition was rather cold for my legs and my special oil began to freeze.

13
00:01:16,740 --> 00:01:20,780
I paused before I jumped from the starting place on a little spaceship

14
00:01:20,820 --> 00:01:23,080
but then I began my performance.

15
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:28,920
At the correct moment I tried to open my parachute but there was a problem.

16
00:01:29,860 --> 00:01:31,360
It only opened a little.

17
00:01:32,700 --> 00:01:37,100
Instead of flying softly to earth I began to fall faster and faster

18
00:01:37,100 --> 00:01:39,080
so that I could not turn, dive,

19
00:01:39,240 --> 00:01:40,640
circle or dance.

20
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:45,700
My heart stopped beating as I landed heavily on a mountain covered

21
00:01:45,700 --> 00:01:46,860
with snow.

22
00:01:47,780 --> 00:01:52,520
This is why I am writing to you from my hospital bed with two broken legs

23
00:01:52,520 --> 00:01:54,140
and a fragile head.

24
00:01:54,860 --> 00:01:57,980
I did not win anything at the Olympics after all.

25
00:01:58,260 --> 00:02:03,340
I need the factory to build me two new legs and an even bigger head.

26
00:02:03,700 --> 00:02:06,900
Then I will be able to compete once more.

27
00:02:06,900 --> 00:02:09,920
Let’s hope for greater success in the next Olympics!
